                                "sense_id": "fa9616dd-6bf8-3525-9881-666b47fa0bf1",
                                "text": "Why, e'en so. And now my Lady Worm’s, chapless and knocked about the mazard with a sexton’s spade. Here’s fine revolution, an we had the trick to see ’t. Did these bones cost no more the breeding but to play at loggets with them? Mine ache to think on ’t."
